  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Random graphs\n",
    "### Microcanonical ensemble of networks with N nodes and M edges\n",
    "Analogy with fixed energy E (fixed number of links) "
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 37,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "100%|██████████| 100/100 [00:01<00:00, 63.86it/s]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "N=100\n",
    "M=2000\n",
    "\n",
    "# Create n random graphs\n",
    "n=100\n",
    "\n",
    "Ms=np.zeros(n)\n",
    "for i in tqdm(range(n)):\n",
    "    A = np.zeros((N,N))\n",
    "    for j in range(M):\n",
    "        a = np.random.randint(0,N)\n",
    "        b = np.random.randint(0,N)\n",
    "        while a==b or A[a,b]==1:\n",
    "            a = np.random.randint(0,N)\n",
    "            b = np.random.randint(0,N)\n",
    "        A[a,b]=1\n",
    "        A[b,a]=1\n",
    "    # Save number of edges\n",
    "    Ms[i]=np.sum(A)/2\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Canonical ensemble of networks with N nodes (Erdos-Renyi graph)\n",
    "Analogy with fixed temperature T -> the constraint is the expected value of the energy \\<E\\>, but i can fluctuate"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 38,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stderr",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "100%|██████████| 100/100 [00:00<00:00, 6419.20it/s]\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "N=100\n",
    "p=0.1\n",
    "n=100\n",
    "\n",
    "Ms=np.zeros(n)\n",
    "for i in tqdm(range(n)):\n",
    "    # Matrix of random numbers between 0 and 1 (uniform distribution)\n",
    "    A = np.random.rand(N,N)\n",
    "    # Create adjacency matrix\n",
    "    A = A<p\n",
    "    # Make it symmetric\n",
    "    A = np.triu(A,1)\n",
    "    A = A + A.T\n",
    "    # Save number of edges\n",
    "    Ms[i]=np.sum(A)/2"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 39,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "plt.hist(Ms, bins=20);"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 40,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def erdos_renyi(N,p):\n",
    "    A = np.random.rand(N,N)\n",
    "    A = A<p\n",
    "    A = np.triu(A,1)\n",
    "    A = A + A.T\n",
    "    return A\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 41,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
